              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Relations between health, lifestyle and absenteeism of municipal corporation officials in Rotterdam. Background variables: sex, year of birth, education, marital status / perception of own health / several physical symptoms / blood pressure / weight, length / sports activities / working conditions / satisfaction with job / nutrition, smoking and alcohol consumption habits / use of medicines. Only in P1009b: data on absenteeism. Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ household characteristics/ income/capital assets/ education</p>"
                }
              },
